When I know there's an altar on the level, I usually attack monsters and
start to run back toward the altar, leading them on and killing 'em right
next to it so there's not a lot of trouble moving.  (If you take too long to
get the corpse to the altar, it will rot and your god won't accept it.)


>I've seen stuff about converting altars, but HOW is that done?? I tried 
>praying, sacrificing... Please help before I start all over again!

Anyting you #offer at a non-coaligned altar, the two gods will fight for
control of the altar.  The higher your experience level, the better the
chance that your god will win.  By the time you're level 7 or 8, the odds
are quite good.  In the meantime, just remember where the altar is and don't
worry about it too much.

